{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a8998a18909a78724299689c24f8285ff493e70ace4ca91ed3f9858991682fff", "ja": "（今日は、瑞希と新しい衣装の衣装合わせだけど……\n今のところ、特に問題はなさそうだな！）", "zh": "（今天来陪瑞希试穿新服装……\n目前看来，应该没有什么问题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "ca57f916513bd1e83e9ce41db388c9fa8fdc0bc7ccaba9ef377c9685c37e2868", "ja": "これは、水着をモチーフにした衣装ですね。\nとてもかわいいです。……似合ってるかな。", "zh": "这件服装的设计灵感来自泳衣，\n非常可爱呢……我穿起来好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b5f75e96100c21d5b1f4966a665676a252a9a3b95142df5bd2d86b642ed0506f", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるよ。\nそれに、瑞希に合わせて作った衣装だからな。", "zh": "嗯，很好看喔。\n毕竟是为瑞希量身订做的服装嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "193133f15bf7923feef5ee223c88f7cb572fe48fccb47bf1f706ed0d4e76a058", "ja": "たしかに。どんなに動いても、このとおり。\n……ジャストフィットだぞ。", "zh": "的确，不管怎么动都很服贴。\n……完美合身喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5cf6831a2e5a1d2a0a7a7360ca9535ad2b82130e91df6da0e066184f8daf95da", "ja": "うん、良かった。\n用意した甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "嗯，太好了。\n不枉费我准备了这套服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "6b3ad60a1043b62bcf98f41dab0684d034cedfddb5895b63393083defc1b22af", "ja": "はい。素敵な衣装をもらえて、うれしいです。\nおかげで、気合いも十分です。……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "是的，可以拿到这么棒的服装，我很开心。\n多亏如此，我也充满了干劲……瑞希，要拚啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "49cbe5fc43f0c326c9547812db529ad251c3792a556a553dfe09074898aa5c45", "ja": "{$P$}。せっかくの機会です。\n{$P$}も、水着にしませんか。", "zh": "{$P$}，難得有這個機會，\n你要不要也改穿泳衣呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "02ed038f1ce5e263d799a489093cfc682c19dc663fef22e9d1df623550e774ba", "ja": "水着にするって……服を？", "zh": "改穿泳衣……你是指当成一般衣服穿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "d49f7a8ae789675a48bb269415a2bca500cc6029de4d4013d3971dcf8ab0f05e", "ja": "はい。動きやすくて、便利ではないかと。\n……夏にスーツは、暑そう。", "zh": "是的，穿泳衣很好活动，我想应该很方便。\n……毕竟夏天穿西装，感觉很热。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eff504fbabd77d65ce8938fbfd40f151b2c8513d115bb3bd1205e2279baab239", "ja": "うん……俺の事を考えてくれたのはうれしいけど、\n人と会う事も多い仕事だし、どうかな。それに……。", "zh": "嗯……你为我着想，我是很高兴，\n但我的工作常要与人见面，可能不太适合，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "29f8f8c6f545f0604722e5f105eb16f7509b200cc77bd948e3a3531fc9f1cd0d", "ja": "それに、なんでしょう？\n何か、重大な問題が……くしゅん。", "zh": "而且什么？\n莫非有什么重大问题……哈啾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "d758bf41af780bbde46f94a3abe13b55737795a046a67c6f71028a28ecd8f6f2", "ja": "はっ。もしや……。", "zh": "啊！该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7600cb74833acc1417ca03b677b7daadbf3ef37c87197fcd305cba5220bb04e7", "ja": "ああ。常にそこまで薄着だと、\n流石に風邪をひくかなって……。", "zh": "是啊，一直穿得那么单薄，\n我想应该会感冒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "bdcb6ff9ea3694db7409d318990019816cd520d2ef5b6d6830d9b97884adf342", "ja": "なるほど……普段使いには向いていないようです。\n涼しくて、良いと思ったのですが。", "zh": "原来如此……看来泳衣不适合当成日常的穿着。\n本来还以为穿得清凉会很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6e15a07cf23d726babde559343ccfd5372c0da6c62e3887a5c3382a804896920", "ja": "はは、そういう事だ。それより瑞希、寒そうだけど……\n俺の上着でよければ、羽織っておくか？", "zh": "哈哈，就是这样。倒是瑞希，你看起来好像很冷……\n不介意的话，要不要披上我的外套？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "66e0faefb1f4a64c1f43c4754c9dce1d19ca0aff3472fd6c024b1cf5930f7113", "ja": "{$P$}の上着……\n借りても、いいんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}的外套……\n借给我没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e7f52bd729ac8f4176f118bf56069c4d9e99f26a6bf178133bf3f84fe25b79d2", "ja": "もちろん。衣装合わせ、まだ時間がかかりそうだし……\nみんなの体調を管理するのもプロデューサーの仕事だ。", "zh": "当然没关系，毕竟试穿服装似乎还要再花一些时间……\n照顾大家的身体健康也是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "90d4bc4f16994b624ff6b9aeb3fca7a7959a308f77ba0ddb756e4d9a332d3bf6", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nでは、遠慮なく。……いそいそ。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n那我就不客气了……（高高兴兴）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "71608d9f194fd6f746ae5dc772cb2a8b8383163e06bfb60dbe3f99639a2217a7", "ja": "と、思いましたが……\n今日のところは、やめておきます。", "zh": "我原本想这样回你……\n不过，今天就先不必了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b90955a5435681e0299266e55b1ebf90fadcf8b11bae86a4a8bdc5312c815102", "ja": "やめておくって……大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "怎么说先不必了……难道你不冷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b850ac815c819295853b2d9712c9dce04720588f97858e20294707e7e4e213f", "ja": "はい。動いていれば、寒くありませんし。\n衣装合わせは、あとすこしで終わりですから。", "zh": "是的，只要一直动就不会冷，\n而且试穿再一下子就结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0154_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "16b4d7b3b7ba95883d8bccefbff4ae5c8f7d93599b773588ebe828b32f445309", "ja": "その代わり……{$P$}。終わったら\n一緒に、温かいお茶はどうですか。……ほっこり。", "zh": "相对的……{$P$}，\n结束后要不要一起喝杯热茶……（暖洋洋）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
